<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="intro-summaries">
  <title>Introduction to Summary Statistics</title>
  
  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces summary statistics. For a broader overview of descriptive methods, see
      <xref ref="distributions"/> and <xref ref="sec-numeric-summaries"/>. For an external reference, see the
      <url href="https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/">NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook of Statistical Methods</url>.
    </p>
  </introduction>

</chapter>
